{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "dfd599b393d1a4ba2ee5f9c755d3bfb8f7af51674aa7784104882526b434e121", "ja": "消えた台本", "zh": "消失的剧本", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "f187c0a97a595e9d94b152482f3773bb367192b917515465f4040cc9eaa55506", "ja": "衣装合わせも兼ねて、通し稽古をする事に\nなったアイドル達。だが練習を始めようと\nして、琴葉の台本がなくなった事に気づく。\nそんな中、探偵になりきった紬が言い放つ。\n「犯人は、この中にいますっ！」", "zh": "偶像们来试穿戏服，并接着进行排演。\n但正当要开始练习时，\n琴叶发现自己的剧本不见了。\n就在此时，彻底融入侦探角色的䌷坚定说道：\n「犯人就在我们之中！」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0da21e3657f0a4a07688573a90237e8568670933bfd176856cd61418eef6269b", "ja": "（今日は『屋根裏の道化師』の衣装合わせ……\nついでに、仮衣装を着て通し稽古を行うことになった）", "zh": "（今天是《阁楼里的小丑》进行试装……\n接着要顺便穿着暂定的戏服排演。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_04_1001_051tmg", "source_sha256": "2003fabd4b6314ce35b1cf1d9d244c28be6c947284ad2eef68e088f173187591", "ja": "あの……{$P$}。\nい、いかがでしょうか……？", "zh": "请问……{$P$}，\n你、你觉得如何呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_04_1002_p", "source_sha256": "45161aa662d0d41bf484a62c750beb0c0cb3f9a6b83099243eec57f4850caa72", "ja": "おお……似合ってるじゃないか、紬！\nうん、これなら探偵らしく見えるな。", "zh": "哦哦……䌷穿起来很合适啊！\n嗯，这样看起来就像个侦探了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_04_1003_051tmg", "source_sha256": "bcc9a35c5de3e8abff358d99d1cb6f6eef61139fbe7836f1faf7b992641824cb", "ja": "探偵らしく……ですか？　つまり、\nこれまでは探偵らしく見えなかったと……？", "zh": "像个侦探……吗？你的意思是，\n我之前练习时都不像侦探吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_04_1004_p", "source_sha256": "a602c652b9051b76481b1934c1e80dd883d1b4f14ecd4319b5682b243423fa21", "ja": "い、いや、そうじゃなくて……。\n更によくなった、って事だよ。", "zh": "不、不是，我不是那个意思……\n我的意思是你更有侦探的架式了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_04_1005_017kth", "source_sha256": "9376e8e3622c02a2acceef37df1c75d74fe144ed9dc5bb204817824f7ef5d268", "ja": "そうだよ紬ちゃん、自信を持って。\n衣装も、すごく似合ってるから。", "zh": "对啊，小䌷，你要有自信。\n服装也很适合你喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_04_1006_051tmg", "source_sha256": "16fbc4dfb4b9f6701d0588a4ca18ecfc194a613343edf3fe5146891e4a66fb32", "ja": "そんな……恐縮です。\nあの、田中さんも、たいへんお美しいと思います。", "zh": "怎么会……你过奖了。\n那个，我觉得田中穿起戏服也十分美丽动人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_04_1007_017kth", "source_sha256": "9affef26ed6547de7fdde885b7aae93a184b86f1bfd6cbc22669986e7e40cdb2", "ja": "美しいだなんて、照れちゃうな……\nでも、ありがとう。ふふっ。", "zh": "说我美丽动人，真难为情……\n不过，谢谢夸奖，呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_04_1008_017kth", "source_sha256": "0dc8559d28ff760da44b10630487da4157c3a3be4145ecbe86599841bdb7d390", "ja": "でも……だったら、なおさらいいお芝居をしないと。\nこの衣装を用意してくれた人たちのためにも……。", "zh": "只是……这样一来，就得拿出更好的演技才行。\n这样才对得起为我们准备这些服装的人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_04_1009_p", "source_sha256": "3cbcca7f9e06e902b1f5627686b950008a49cc554c28eb1a62d5346dc4ffae53", "ja": "どうしたんだ、琴葉。\n衣装、どこか合わなかったか？", "zh": "怎么了，琴叶？\n服装有哪里不合身吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_04_1010_017kth", "source_sha256": "3bba87abd674f7438effadaab9a32f76836f16d6358f0a9c6e2ac1f9ede3ded3", "ja": "えっ？　い、いえ。大丈夫です。", "zh": "咦？没、没有，没问题的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_04_1011_039kon", "source_sha256": "f03928ce32662bc67081171ed6c12cf781f863465f1afcc26e8bc668c6cfc5f8", "ja": "……うん。この衣装に袖を通したら、なんだか\n本当の大女優になったような気がしてきたわ！", "zh": "……嗯，穿上这套服装，\n感觉好像真的成为明星女演员了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_04_1012_039kon", "source_sha256": "b2efd041c2bf377629848872e73b89612011c0343b5b984aa831739dd901f504", "ja": "『ああ。やっぱり舞台は私の生きがいだわ……！\nそれに、素敵な殿方の視線を集めるのも……ね？』", "zh": "『啊啊，舞台果然才是我生命的意义……！\n还有，吸引优秀男性的目光也是……对吧？』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_04_1013_044miz", "source_sha256": "cc3c1017293e8bf750869b7439bc30fccfa0cfe7bcfb1c4b3db3a4e882747be1", "ja": "『ええ、シンシアさん。\nあなたこそ、舞台の花と呼ばれるのに相応しい……』", "zh": "『是啊，辛西亚小姐。\n没有人比你更适合称作舞台之花……』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_04_1014_044miz", "source_sha256": "df8e90e5649ad77109f63c908f94da23e749adb3f82c5c4dc47ea868d205c523", "ja": "形から入る、というのでしょうか。衣装を着ると、\n普段より、すんなり役になりきれる気がします。", "zh": "这就是从外在着手的意思吗？\n一穿上戏服，感觉比平时更能自然融入角色。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_04_1015_049mom", "source_sha256": "c238e4c7120d953fdea708c9659a9d744b73082a91a610de51e8dd801e1646b1", "ja": "まあ、そんなに単純じゃないと思うけど……。\n衣装によって、キレイに見える動きとかあるしね。", "zh": "不过，桃子觉得并没有那么单纯……\n一举一动要怎么样才会好看，也会受到服装的影响。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_04_1016_049mom", "source_sha256": "ea710dcfc71659c8672706bc54f919532d728dd412912a89bea8d7589c337360", "ja": "この衣装なら、スカートを引っかけないようにとか。\nそういうのを意識しておくのは、正解だと思うよ。", "zh": "比方说这套服装，就得小心不能让裙摆勾到。\n提醒自己注意这种细节，我想是不会错的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_04_1017_039kon", "source_sha256": "5313cbbc96209403e4d6cb4b6530766b22bd4a801c5e30368e305f740a274bbb", "ja": "なるほど……。\nやっぱり経験者、目のつけどころが違うわね！", "zh": "原来如此……\n不愧是有演戏经验的人，着眼处就是不一样呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_04_1018_044miz", "source_sha256": "3432fa89d7645c50b9a2d7da4003de9339fbf2f3b52e30be5811e7c3bee09084", "ja": "とても参考になります。もっと聞きたいです。\n周防さん……いえ、周防先生。", "zh": "非常有参考价值。\n我还有更多事情想请教你，周防……不，周防老师。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_04_1019_049mom", "source_sha256": "34e9faeff5502e513f8e997c0ff810468a610dd12a8b7d08b4b4979bc3c24ffa", "ja": "も、もう。別に、このくらい基本だよ。", "zh": "真、真是的。这只是基础常识。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_04_1020_049mom", "source_sha256": "5ee82efa457b15095d3e758d9b2333568950e6c953d632f4d031e5504db9ccc1", "ja": "でも、みんながそんなに言うんだったら……\n桃子の知ってる事でよければ、教えてあげる。ふふん♪", "zh": "不过，既然大家都这么说了……\n不介意的话，就让桃子把所学教给你们吧，呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_04_1021_051tmg", "source_sha256": "2f72b1f4423981e1ad3aa1af014920f3def3d2baca40d9c07210bca32cef71a0", "ja": "形から、入る……。\n普段から……意識を……。", "zh": "从外在、着手……\n平时就要……提醒自己……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_04_1022_051tmg", "source_sha256": "6320697efc3228d55bbe3bbb184f299f78724c207ee835c2b77888b3156d6da2", "ja": "つまり、舞台の外でも自分を探偵として考え……\n探偵として行動するべき、と……！？", "zh": "也就是说，在舞台下也要把自己当作侦探……\n融入侦探的角色来行动，是这样吗……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_04_1024_p", "source_sha256": "fc1560b0d29d32efe9eb25bdcb6130dcd91af976352444a2e8a1190a78def940", "ja": "おっと、そろそろ時間だな。\nじゃあみんな、劇場のほうに移動してくれ！", "zh": "哎呀，时间差不多了。\n好啦，大家准备移动到剧场吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_04_1025_051tmg", "source_sha256": "a7d9902957be7c3647d34d77a05b9f4d2d5f69cd70f67d6f943596cce71a4483", "ja": "あ……は、はいっ。", "zh": "啊……好、好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_04_1026_p", "source_sha256": "ce22f87a003475f4a166a65f053b5c9955a49d79310e0da7eb062fb47e81aa48", "ja": "それじゃ、琴葉のシーンからだな。\n琴葉、準備はいいか？", "zh": "那么，从琴叶的场景开始。\n琴叶，准备好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_04_1027_017kth", "source_sha256": "7f28dcf761076eb8490bead55b7394f19f27ec201b6c91913476aa617692ef3d", "ja": "はい……あっ！", "zh": "好的……啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_04_1028_051tmg", "source_sha256": "cc5964e7cd8974d384c7d7d7827a1b0bc1efee9106a1e01e745c48507f88ec14", "ja": "どうかいたしましたか？", "zh": "请问怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_04_1029_017kth", "source_sha256": "c23c021d47329a02c816f8e54d4abed4759732cf8f5950a85cbdfc3183e1ef98", "ja": "ごめんなさい、台本を忘れてきてしまって……\nあの、取りに戻ってもいいでしょうか？", "zh": "对不起，我忘了把剧本带来……\n请问我可以回去拿吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_04_1030_p", "source_sha256": "a7c1c9183b6c5e825269be59624ca5a509b5eeb8822f363c5519412f9d68a485", "ja": "ああ、それなら俺も行くよ。\n更衣室を出るとき、カギをかけてきたからな。", "zh": "好，那我跟你一起去。\n因为离开更衣室时我把门锁上了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_04_1031_017kth", "source_sha256": "dc7f90275ad6ee9e652a807203c6d48e4440d6a48101122b2192ccbe94d27946", "ja": "すみません……。", "zh": "不好意思……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_04_1032_017kth", "source_sha256": "23b361d994114ea963d450b2b4b5743d4ff061daf8c784f7247869aced5a237f", "ja": "えっ？　私の台本が……ない！？", "zh": "咦？我的剧本……不在这里！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_04_1033_p", "source_sha256": "4e477fa2046728853dae9b6c609ff3c3af6faa85995d5b88dcf212911418992e", "ja": "ないって……琴葉の台本が？", "zh": "你说……剧本不在这里？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_04_1034_017kth", "source_sha256": "ac7bf84fee45b3c55ed0f84007d3b298c8392e1291d998fa06b2767ff14da8cf", "ja": "はい。\n確かに、ここに置いていたはずなのに……。", "zh": "是的。\n我记得应该放在这附近才对……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_04_1035_049mom", "source_sha256": "f68cc56e77266c2f320ac05d6e351a6d676f108aa7619e9eceb31ac63fdbdbec", "ja": "……お兄ちゃん、琴葉さん。\nそろそろ、練習始めるよ。", "zh": "……大哥哥、琴叶姊，\n练习差不多要开始啰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_04_1036_p", "source_sha256": "9bc1f7eeab77204cfb8eb471be8bdf909effafa5aa41cc4b6d6236763e5110ec", "ja": "なんだ、みんな来ちゃったのか。\n実は、琴葉の台本が……見当たらないんだ。", "zh": "怎么？大家都跑来了吗？\n是这样的，琴叶的剧本……找不到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_04_1037_039kon", "source_sha256": "53ea36893c6243b03665a1baef507b94083a5142fbc1272b1880ef154b398118", "ja": "えっ、なくなっちゃったの？\nでもこの部屋、カギはかかってたんでしょ？", "zh": "什么？所以是不见了吗？\n但刚刚不是有上锁吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_04_1038_044miz", "source_sha256": "5effffe12c3d083616fc08c8950c8a869dcd95c0e7af7092d5cc2fdb669f9b10", "ja": "密室から消えた台本。……イリュージョン？\nそれとも、ミステリー、でしょうか。", "zh": "从密室里消失的剧本……是魔术吗？\n还是神秘力量呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_04_1039_051tmg", "source_sha256": "2c1a8de6be685c685373a31d731a1c889127c95e4e125b458ea2a4691ea8684d", "ja": "これは……事件です！", "zh": "发生……事件了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_04_1040_017kth", "source_sha256": "d0acb9d845a6e8001376bfa78e331731d6999a02db8f3111e0e77f1ad0d6b4e0", "ja": "えっ？　じ、事件？", "zh": "什么？事、事件？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_04_1041_p", "source_sha256": "05fce795888d36696c95a98d2ceac1b6f40357826dbf37fce6ec0e9694529155", "ja": "紬、どうした？\n急に大きな声を出したりして……。", "zh": "䌷，你怎么了？\n突然喊这么大声……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_04_1042_051tmg", "source_sha256": "e1f35e2dd3b907fea5777bc5b5de6af86b3574fa55d007ba88fbe7834e5eed24", "ja": "しっ！　……勝手な発言は控えてください、\n{$P$}。", "zh": "嘘！请你谨慎发言，\n{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_04_1043_051tmg", "source_sha256": "8e4b5ef4f1af6f5915ec86eb86042aa0acbb8e9ad4ba78e84304cbd639505bb3", "ja": "この部屋にいるのは、全員この事件の重要参考人……\nすなわち、容疑者なのですから！", "zh": "在这房间里的所有人都是本案的重要证人……\n也就是，嫌犯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_04_1044_p", "source_sha256": "2a19ef68342faa8611dac16d3c86628d9961d0500b31181ddc3068837b3ac8a4", "ja": "よ、容疑者だって！？\n紬、それはいったい……。", "zh": "你、你说嫌犯！？\n䌷，这到底是怎么回事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_04_1045_051tmg", "source_sha256": "b1dda2a03abf9a6c09d573f4b6804d0e13c8e45951b6bb6901170a17d8291f85", "ja": "今の私は、白石紬ではありません。\n私は名探偵ウォーカー……。", "zh": "我现在不是白石䌷。\n我是名侦探沃克……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_04_1046_051tmg", "source_sha256": "68e57f1e830af7b22d6aa6abd2538d28267c237c18e5c41f2b8d8f3bacb1d711", "ja": "そして今、私がすべきこととは！\nこの複雑怪奇な事件の謎を解き明かすことです！", "zh": "而我现在该做的事情！\n就是解开这错综复杂事件的谜团！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_04_1047_049mom", "source_sha256": "004b0e5cc64b3b440303af2c7aa5d2a01e9d94e1fab8789a715e6fcd39d5dfc4", "ja": "ということは、もしかして……。", "zh": "这么说，该不会……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_04_1048_051tmg", "source_sha256": "36c63e78b36cd050af41f2704da6efba19487b50719280359b2839c545db86c4", "ja": "ええ！　……犯人は、この中にいますっ！", "zh": "没错……犯人就在我们之中！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
